    //  2. the spiral untangles into a wavy line again;
    //  3. the line flies on, rippling along a curve, to where the logo's mark is (its tail thins out as it goes);
    //  4. there it draws the mark, stroke after stroke, along the real drawing; the real logo takes over;
    //  5. the designs fly out of the logo into the fan.
